  "properties": {
    "title": "Geoservercloud in a nutshell",
    "description": "In this presentation, we will explore a practical example of using GeoServerCloud within a local cluster, specifically focusing on catalog configuration in the database. We'll simplify the complex process of deploying an application in a Kubernetes cluster using Helm. This task is challenging, especially when the application has a microservices architecture. Our goal is to bridge the technical gap, ensuring developers don't need to become DevOps experts to integrate GeoServerCloud into their applications.",
